WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.921
can examine a specific case study
published by Resnick in 2009.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.221
The proposed study centers on testing a
novel analgesic drug,

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.321
one designed specifically to relieve the intense
pain associated with severe thermal burns.

4
00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.661
This clinical schematic shows the exact
design submitted to the committee.

5
00:00:18.141 --> 00:00:21.960
The protocol requires two distinct groups,
totaling 24 dogs.

6
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:25.381
Both groups receive a severe burn and
standard treatment.

7
00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.520
However, only one group receives the
experimental drug.

8
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.520
If you are sitting on the Institutional
Animal Care and Use Committee,

9
00:00:33.421 --> 00:00:36.321
evaluating this exact design against the
legal frameworks we just covered,

10
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.400
would you choose to approve this study?

11
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:45.000
Actively interrogating the severe friction between a
researcher's scientific ambition and a subject's physical

12
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.780
suffering is the exact function of the
oversight committee.

13
00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.921
To reach a resolution, the committee
members must aggressively cross-

14
00:00:51.921 --> 00:00:54.881
reference this burn protocol against
European, national,

15
00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:56.280
and institutional standards.

16
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.000
They must first apply the principle of
replacement.

17
00:00:59.761 --> 00:01:03.101
The board determines if a burn study of
this nature could yield valid data

18
00:01:03.101 --> 00:01:06.060
using a lower phylogenetic model, such as
rodents,

19
00:01:06.261 --> 00:01:07.261
rather than canines.

20
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.800
Next, they apply the principle of
stewardship.

21
00:01:10.421 --> 00:01:11.800
The committee evaluates the math.

22
00:01:12.321 --> 00:01:15.000
Is the request for 24 subjects
statistically justified?

23
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.481
Or could the exact same significance be
achieved with fewer animals?

24
00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:22.601
Ultimately, the committee determines if
the potential scientific value of

25
00:01:22.601 --> 00:01:27.080
the new analgesic genuinely justifies the
deliberate severe pain inflicted on the subjects.

26
00:01:27.981 --> 00:01:31.680
Modern biological research relies entirely
on this rigorous compliance architecture.

27
00:01:32.321 --> 00:01:36.361
It guarantees that every single instance of
sanctioned harm is scientifically irreplaceable,

28
00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:38.881
legally justified, and relentlessly
minimized.
